Issue body actions

On MacOS, `wxMessageDialog` uses a native dialog that shows the application icon. When used with the `wxICON_ERROR` style, an error icon (exclamation mark triangle) is displayed with the application icon, but only with the `wxYES_NO` style, not with the `wxOK` style.
The expected behaviour is to always show the error icon when the `wxICON_ERROR` style is present. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
